  "nameEn": "Long Street with Sparks",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk to the end of the street. If the lamp is sparking — repair and light it; else if there is a lamp here — light it.",
  "descriptionEn": "A long street where the lamps are sometimes fine and sometimes sparking. A \"While\" loop leads along the street, and a chain of conditions decides what to do on each tile.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk to the end of the street. If the lamp is sparking — just repair it; else if there is a lamp here — turn it off."
